# AI
CLAUDE.md

# Data and build artifacts, rebuilt by the pipeline, never committed. IEEE-CIS
# competition rules restrict redistribution, so nothing derived from the dataset
# itself is tracked. data/manifest.json is the exception: it records what was
# fetched, without containing any of it.
data/*
!data/manifest.json
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.db
models/

.ipynb_checkpoints/
